1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Skip Badaling — 10 million tourists a year.
I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
It's the most crowded stretch of the Great Wall.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Mutianyu gets about a third of those crowds.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
And it's the longest fully restored section — 23 towers.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Cable car up, then a toboggan ride down.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Double-tap if you'd pick the quieter wall.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
★ Expert Tip: Do Mutianyu on a weekday morning, before the buses.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Badaling or Mutianyu — which would you book? Comment below.
